## 4. Analysis Matrix

| Attack Vector | Delivery Method | Psychological Lever Exploited | Key Technical Defense |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Phishing** | Email / Web | Urgency, Fear, Curiosity | DMARC/DKIM/SPF, Phishing-Resistant MFA |
| **Pretexting** | Phone Calls / Chat | Authority, Willingness to Help | Secondary Channel Verification |
| **Baiting** | USB Drive / Downloads | Curiosity, Greed | Disabling Autorun, USB Device Control Policies |

